HI_dayo/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/49eb2855/uploads/origins/e4bc0f1d-2ad9-439c-973d-3b330943efbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2f9654696ab92962181cbd68ac563b9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/49eb2855/uploads/origins/e4bc0f1d-2ad9-439c-973d-3b330943efbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2f9654696ab92962181cbd68ac563b9, https://si.imgix.net/49eb2855/uploads/origins/e4bc0f1d-2ad9-439c-973d-3b330943efbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13871f938e8d37d650615eaee79f1a0b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/49eb2855/uploads/origins/e4bc0f1d-2ad9-439c-973d-3b330943efbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1eaca6337def46157073be7173aff035 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "朔兎くんのこと描いてくれるとうれし〜です✌️\n\n〈髪〉\n白寄りの銀髪、長髪(肩甲骨辺りまで)、\n横髪ピンク、\nストレート、アホ毛なし、\n前髪重め(右目、向かって左の目が半分隠れるくらい)\n〈顔〉\n切れ長のツリ目、赤目(朱殷)、ギザ歯、口内は黒\n目尻側のまつ毛が長め↓イメージ\nhttps://twitter.com/arukarider/status/1458977039541628930 \n〈肌〉\n不健康な色白、クマあり、\nスナッグに埋まりかけのピアス穴\n〈衣装〉\n丸眼鏡(フレームは華奢で大きめ)\n白シャツに黒ネクタイ(無地)\n胸ポケットにスマホ(黒iPhone)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@KIRABOSHI_dayo/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/45d092a0/uploads/origins/c6b7ab25-cd4c-420b-b370-9603fa7ed026?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fa94eaf75b095123b633b58adfc8d00", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/45d092a0/uploads/origins/c6b7ab25-cd4c-420b-b370-9603fa7ed026?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fa94eaf75b095123b633b58adfc8d00, https://si.imgix.net/45d092a0/uploads/origins/c6b7ab25-cd4c-420b-b370-9603fa7ed026?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=afdf848375a25d11de2f0f2734f28a91 2x, https://si.imgix.net/45d092a0/uploads/origins/c6b7ab25-cd4c-420b-b370-9603fa7ed026?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp